	measure 'Card PPAC Target' = ( VAR _v = [Profit per Active Customer Target] RETURN SWITCH ( TRUE (), ISBLANK ( _v ), BLANK (), ABS ( _v ) >= 10000000, FORMAT ( DIVIDE ( _v, 10000000 ), "₹#,##0.00", "en-US" ) & " Cr", ABS ( _v ) >= 1000000, FORMAT ( DIVIDE ( _v, 100000 ), "₹#,##0.0", "en-US" ) & " L", ABS ( _v ) >= 100000, FORMAT ( DIVIDE ( _v, 100000 ), "₹#,##0.00", "en-US" ) & " L", FORMAT ( _v, "₹#,##0", "en-US" ) ) )
		displayFolder: 6 Display
		lineageTag: 4234199a-f5e6-467c-bf7e-39e5304b0546

	/// Average order value for cards.
	measure 'Card AOV' = ( VAR _v = [Avg Order Value] RETURN SWITCH ( TRUE (), ISBLANK ( _v ), BLANK (), ABS ( _v ) >= 10000000, FORMAT ( DIVIDE ( _v, 10000000 ), "₹#,##0.00", "en-US" ) & " Cr", ABS ( _v ) >= 1000000, FORMAT ( DIVIDE ( _v, 100000 ), "₹#,##0.0", "en-US" ) & " L", ABS ( _v ) >= 100000, FORMAT ( DIVIDE ( _v, 100000 ), "₹#,##0.00", "en-US" ) & " L", FORMAT ( _v, "₹#,##0", "en-US" ) ) )
		displayFolder: 6 Display
		lineageTag: 91b310fc-26ea-4796-a7cd-6949adc556a3

	/// Orders per active customer for cards.
	measure 'Card Orders per Customer' = FORMAT ( [Orders per Active Customer], "0.00" )
		displayFolder: 6 Display
		lineageTag: 709f5596-0a2f-4c75-a582-9b2b62517f80

	/// Active customers for cards.
